# Tailwind v4 Global Tokens

Define the design system in `app/globals.css` via `@theme` / `@theme inline`. Do not add `tailwind.config.js` color duplicates unless required for a plugin.

## Required `@theme` colors

```css
@theme {
  --color-navy: #0D1B3E;
  --color-navydark: #080f22;
  --color-navymid: #0a1530;
  --color-teal: #19D3C5;
  --color-teal-hover: #15bdb0;
  --color-violet: #5C3D8F;
  --color-orange: #FF6B35;
  --color-footer: #0c0033;
  --color-surface-muted: #f8f9fa;
  --font-sans: "Plus Jakarta Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --breakpoint-nav: 1377px; /* custom nav density */
}
```

Use classes: `bg-navy`, `text-teal`, `border-orange`, `bg-surface-muted`, `min-[1377px]:…` or `nav:`.

## Global base (globals.css)

```css
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-x: clip; }
body { font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--color-navy); background: #fff; }
section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 96px; }
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
}
```

## Shared utility classes (port from Designs once)

- `.bg-gradient-hero` → `135deg, #0D1B3E → #2b1a6b`
- `.suricat-teal-btn`, `.nav-link-animated`, `.section-transition` / `.reveal-transition`
- Footer: prefer `bg-navy` (HTML often overrides `.footer-bg #0c0033`)

## Forbidden in route/page files

- Inline `@media` blocks that belong in globals or a component CSS module
- Hardcoded hex when a token exists (`#19D3C5` → `teal`)
- CDN Tailwind `tailwind.config = {…}` scripts
